<title>USA: Graphic Industries names Martin Kendall CFO.</title>
<headline>Graphic Industries names Martin Kendall CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Graphic Industries Inc Tuesday said it named its director of acquisitions Martin Kendall as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The commercial printing company said Kendall, who will keep his responsibilities as director of acquisitions, replaces David Fraser, who recently resigned.</p>
